\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 How does a new player learn it exists?\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Player learns through collecting fruits, the point number indicates +,  follow with points, which hints that player got points by touching fruits.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The score bar shows 0 at the beginning. The score increases when player collects fruit. The increasing number is equal to Point Number Popup player sees when the fruits are collected.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The text is located in the middle of the screen. The fruit will drop from the top of the screen which gives player time to read the information before starting the action.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Game Over Screen will pop up when player touches the red fruit. The screen contains Hi-score: , Score: (currently both scores only show number 9999.), Retry Button, and Quit Button. \cell \lastrow\row
